{"id":10053,"name":"aggron-mega","speciesId":306,"dex":306,"form":"mega","generation":3,"types":["steel"],"stats":{"hp":70,"attack":140,"defense":230,"special-attack":60,"special-defense":80,"speed":50},"abilities":[{"name":"filter","hidden":false}],"height":22,"weight":3950,"baseExp":284,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10053.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/10053.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10053.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/10053.ogg","genus":"Iron Armor Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon Armadura de Ferro","flavor":[{"version":"ruby","text":"AGGRON claims an entire mountain as its own territory. It mercilessly beats up anything that violates its environment. This POKéMON vigilantly patrols its territory at all times."},{"version":"sapphire","text":"AGGRON is surprisingly protective of its environment. If its mountain is ravaged by a landslide or a fire, this POKéMON will haul topsoil to the area, plant trees, and beautifully restore its own territory."},{"version":"emerald","text":"Its iron horns grow longer a little at a time. They are used to determine the AGGRON’s age. The gouges in its armor are worn with pride as mementos from battles."},{"version":"firered","text":"It claims a large mountain as its sole territory. It mercilessly thrashes those that violate its space."},{"version":"diamond","text":"While seeking iron for food, it digs tunnels by breaking through bedrock with its steel horns."},{"version":"heartgold","text":"You can tell its age by the length of its iron horns. It claims an entire mountain as its territory."},{"version":"black-2","text":"It claims an entire mountain as its own. The more wounds it has, the more it has battled, so don’t take it lightly."},{"version":"omega-ruby","text":"Aggron claims an entire mountain as its own territory. It mercilessly beats up anything that violates its environment. This Pokémon vigilantly patrols its territory at all times."},{"version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Aggron is protective of its environment. If its mountain is ravaged by a landslide or a fire, this Pokémon will haul topsoil to the area, plant trees, and beautifully restore its own territory."},{"version":"sword","text":"Aggron has a horn sharp enough to perforate thick iron sheets. It brings down its opponents by ramming into them horn first."},{"version":"shield","text":"Long ago, there was a king who wore a helmet meant to resemble the head of an Aggron. He was trying to channel the Pokémon’s strength."}],"flavorPt":"Há muito tempo, havia um rei que usava um capacete que lembrava a cabeça de um Aggron. Ele estava tentando canalizar a força do Pokémon.","genderRate":4,"captureRate":45,"eggGroups":["monster"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"aron","speciesId":304,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Nível 32"],"species":"lairon","speciesId":305,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Nível 42"],"species":"aggron","speciesId":306,"evolvesTo":[]}]}]},"varieties":[{"id":306,"name":"aggron","form":"normal","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/306.png"},{"id":10053,"name":"aggron-mega","form":"mega","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10053.png"}],"games":[15,16,17,18],"moves":[{"id":7,"learn":[[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0]]},{"id":8,"learn":[[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0]]},{"id":9,"learn":[[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0]]},{"id":15,"learn":[[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0]]},{"id":29,"learn":[[15,"lv",1],[15,"lv",8],[16,"lv",1],[16,"lv",7],[17,"lv",1],[17,"lv",7],[18,"lv",1],[18,"lv",7]]},{"id":33,"learn":[[15,"lv",1],[16,"lv",1],[17,"lv",1],[18,"lv",1]]},{"id":36,"learn":[[15,"lv",22],[16,"lv",28],[17,